### Define Resource Templates with URI Parameters in FastMCP

Source: https://github.com/prefecthq/fastmcp/blob/main/docs/servers/resources.mdx

Define dynamic resources by embedding `{parameter_name}` placeholders in the URI string of the `@mcp.resource` decorator. These placeholders map to function arguments, allowing clients to request resources with varying inputs.

